{"id":"73e86b7516dd1e83","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-regex-law-singleton-test.md","title":"正则表达式代数律的单字符检验","display":"thm-regex-law-singleton-test — 正则表达式代数律的单字符检验","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-regex-law-singleton-test","aliases":["73-thm-regex-law-singleton-test"],"display":"thm-regex-law-singleton-test — 正则表达式代数律的单字符检验","depends_on":["[[73-df-regex-language-valuation]]","[[73-df-regex-denotation]]","[[73-df-language-substitution]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§3.4.6–3.4.7, Theorem 3.13 and law test, print pp. 118–121; PDF pp. 140–143","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":3},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-regex-law-singleton-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-regex-law-singleton-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regex-law-singleton-test — 正则表达式代数律的单字符检验"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d09e544c417402c\" href=\"?note=0d09e544c417402c\" title=\"73-df-regex-language-valuation\">73-df-regex-language-valuation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d47feb8e4b903a2e\" href=\"?note=d47feb8e4b903a2e\" title=\"73-df-regex-denotation\">73-df-regex-denotation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"843165cc8d06b8df\" href=\"?note=843165cc8d06b8df\" title=\"73-df-language-substitution\">73-df-language-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§3.4.6–3.4.7, Theorem 3.13 and law test, print pp. 118–121; PDF pp. 140–143"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,F\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_X\">\\(E,F\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_X\\)</span>；赋值语义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0d09e544c417402c\" href=\"?note=0d09e544c417402c\" title=\"73-df-regex-language-valuation\">73-df-regex-language-valuation</a>。量化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为有限非空字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\">\\(\\theta:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ E⟧_X=⟦ F⟧_X\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\theta:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\;\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)=\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(F)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ E⟧_X=⟦ F⟧_X\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\theta:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\;\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)=\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(F)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对表达式结构归纳，赋值语义等于对单字符语义逐字执行语言代换；该代换保持并、连接与星号，所以左式推出所有赋值等式。反向取 Σ=X、θ(x)={〈x〉}。不需要假设被代入语言正则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-regex-language-valuation","status":"resolved","id":"0d09e544c417402c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regex-language-valuation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regex-denotation","status":"resolved","id":"d47feb8e4b903a2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regex-denotation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-language-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"843165cc8d06b8df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-language-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regex-language-valuation","status":"resolved","id":"0d09e544c417402c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 为字母表，$E,F\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_X$；赋值语义见 [[73-df-regex-language-valuation]]。量化的 $\\Sigma$ 为有限非空字母表，$\\theta:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"E,F\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ E⟧_X=⟦ F⟧_X\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\theta:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\;\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(E)=\\operatorname{Eval}_\\theta(F)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1538,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-regex-law-singleton-test|正则表达式代数律的单字符检验]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["0d09e544c417402c","d47feb8e4b903a2e","843165cc8d06b8df"]}